     5190         then do:
     5191           for each buf_stk-line exclusive-lock
     5192             where buf_stk-line.obj-type   = buf_gds-obj.obj-type
     5193               and buf_stk-line.obj-code   = buf_gds-obj.obj-code
     5194               and buf_stk-line.artic      = buf_gds-obj.artic
